WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.236
&gt;&gt; SECRETARY BLINKEN, WELCOME
TO THE PROGRAM.

00:00:03.236 --> 00:00:05.405
&gt;&gt; CHRISTIANE, GREAT TO BE WITH
YOU.

00:00:05.405 --> 00:00:10.777
&gt;&gt; I JUST WANTED TO ASK YOU.
YOU HAVE JUST BEEN MEETING WITH

00:00:10.777 --> 00:00:15.648
YOUR UKRAINIAN COUNTERPART.
HE TOLD YOU ALL THAT THEY NEED

00:00:15.648 --> 00:00:19.119
WEAPONS FASTER, FASTER, AND
FASTER.

00:00:19.119 --> 00:00:21.855
IS IT TRUE THAT NATO IS RUNNING
OUT OF AMMUNITION?

00:00:21.855 --> 00:00:25.725
FOR INSTANCE, ARTILLERY.
UKRAINIANS ARE USING IT.

00:00:25.725 --> 00:00:30.897
&gt;&gt; FROM DAY ONE, IN FACT, EVEN
BEFORE DAY ONE, EVEN BEFORE THE

00:00:30.897 --> 00:00:33.900
RUSSIAN AGGRESSION STARTED,
THIS IS WHAT WE SAW COMING.

00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:36.202
WE HAVE BEEN WORKING WITH THE
UKRAINIANS TO GET THEM WHAT

00:00:36.202 --> 00:00:39.706
THEY NEED TO DEFEND THEMSELVES
AND PUSH BACK THE RUSSIAN

00:00:39.706 --> 00:00:42.742
AGGRESSION.
EVERY STEP ALONG THE WAY, IN

00:00:42.742 --> 00:00:45.745
CONSULTATION WITH THEM, IN
CONSULTATION WITH ALLIES AND

00:00:45.745 --> 00:00:49.949
PARTNERS, WE HAVE ADJUSTED AS
THE NATURE OF THE AGGRESSION IT

00:00:49.949 --> 00:00:52.118
IS SHIFTING.
THEY ARE GETTING IT INTO THEIR

00:00:52.118 --> 00:00:54.921
HANDS AS QUICKLY AS POSSIBLE.
THAT IS EXACTLY WHAT THEY

00:00:54.921 --> 00:00:59.959
NEEDED TO DEAL WITH PUTIN'S WAR.
THAT PROCESS CONTINUES.

00:00:59.959 --> 00:01:03.663
WE ARE NOW VERY FOCUSED ON AIR
DEFENSE SYSTEMS AND NOT JUST US,

00:01:03.663 --> 00:01:06.766
BUT MANY OTHER COUNTRIES.
WE ARE WORKING TO MAKE SURE

00:01:06.766 --> 00:01:09.936
THAT THE UKRAINIANS GET THOSE
SYSTEMS AS QUICKLY AS POSSIBLE.

00:01:09.936 --> 00:01:12.138
BUT ALSO AS EFFECTIVELY AS
POSSIBLE.

00:01:12.138 --> 00:01:15.909
MAKING SURE THEY ARE TRAINED ON
THE, MAKING SURE THEY HAVE THE

00:01:15.909 --> 00:01:18.811
ABILITY TO MAINTAIN THEM.
ALL OF THAT HAS TO COME

00:01:18.811 --> 00:01:19.712
TOGETHER.
IT IS.

00:01:19.712 --> 00:01:24.684
WE HAVE A VERY DELIBERATE
PROCESS ESTABLISHED BY THE

00:01:24.684 --> 00:01:25.818
SECRETARY OF DEFENSE, LLOYD
AUSTIN.

00:01:25.818 --> 00:01:29.856
THAT IS IN RAMSTEIN, GERMANY.
THEY MEET REGULARLY TO MAKE

00:01:29.856 --> 00:01:31.824
SURE THE UKRAINIANS GET WHAT
THEY NEED AND WHEN THEY NEED

00:01:31.824 --> 00:01:37.130
IT.
&gt;&gt; THIS IS FROM THE PENTAGON

00:01:37.130 --> 00:01:41.034
AND YOU AT NATO IT IS REGARDING
THE AMERICAN PATRIOTS.

00:01:41.034 --> 00:01:43.970
LIKE YOU SAID, THEY NEED THE
ANTI OR DEFENSE SYSTEMS.

00:01:43.970 --> 00:01:47.440
YOU MUST THINK THAT THEY NEED
MORE IRVINE.

00:01:47.440 --> 00:01:50.109
TO ME A PUTIN'S RATCHETING UP
HIS MISSILE ATTACK, HIS MISSILE

00:01:50.109 --> 00:01:54.981
WARS AGAINST THESE CITIES.
WILL THE UNITED STATES GIVE

00:01:54.981 --> 00:01:58.951
PATRIOT SYSTEMS?
IF NOT, WHY NOT?

00:01:58.951 --> 00:02:03.223
&gt;&gt; HOW DO NOT WANT TO SPEAK TO
THE SPECIFIC SYSTEMS.

00:02:03.223 --> 00:02:06.926
THE PENTAGON IS FOCUSED ON.
AT WHAT WE DO, WE MAKE SURE

00:02:06.926 --> 00:02:09.929
THAT IT ANY GIVEN TIME THEY
HAVE THE MOST EFFECTIVE SYSTEMS

00:02:09.929 --> 00:02:11.631
POSSIBLE TO DEAL WITH THE
THREAT THEY ARE FACING.

00:02:11.631 --> 00:02:15.835
WE JUST RECENTLY PROVIDED THEM
WITH A VERY EFFECTIVE SYSTEM

00:02:15.835 --> 00:02:19.305
THAT THEY ARE USING VERY
EFFECTIVELY.

00:02:19.305 --> 00:02:22.241
BEFORE THAT, WE HAD THE HIGH
MARKS.

00:02:22.241 --> 00:02:24.577
THEY USED TO GET THAT IN GREAT
EFFECT.

00:02:24.577 --> 00:02:27.947
BOTH IF THEY HAD SOUTHERN AND
EASTERN UKRAINE.

00:02:27.947 --> 00:02:31.217
VIRTUALLY EVERY SINGLE DAY, THE
PENTAGON IS LOOKING AT THIS.

00:02:31.217 --> 00:02:33.386
THEY ARE LISTENING TO THE
UKRAINIANS.

00:02:33.386 --> 00:02:35.554
THEY ARE CONSULTING THE ALLIES
AND PARTNERS.

00:02:35.554 --> 00:02:39.225
IF WE DON'T HAVE SOMETHING, WE
ARE TRYING TO FIND ELSEWHERE.

00:02:39.225 --> 00:02:42.028
THAT IS PART OF THIS ENTIRE
COORDINATION PROCESS.

00:02:42.028 --> 00:02:47.066
&gt;&gt; WHAT GOES THROUGH YOUR MIND
WHEN YOU SEE HOW PRESIDENT

00:02:47.066 --> 00:02:52.972
PUTIN AND THE RUSSIAN MILITARY
IS BASICALLY SHIFTING FROM YOUR

00:02:52.972 --> 00:02:56.909
FAILURES ON THE BATTLEFIELD,
LOSSES OF TERRITORY TO THIS

00:02:56.909 --> 00:03:05.885
RELENTLESS ATTACK ON THE CITIES.
ARE YOU SATISFIED THAT AS MUCH

00:03:05.885 --> 00:03:09.088
HERE IS SOPHISTICATED?
MISSILE DEFENSE SYSTEMS ARE

00:03:09.088 --> 00:03:13.960
GETTING TO THEM IN TIME.
&gt;&gt; WHAT WE ARE SEEING, LET'S

00:03:13.960 --> 00:03:16.996
PUT IT IN ONE WORD.
THAT IS BARBARIC.

00:03:16.996 --> 00:03:21.934
THIS IS PRECISELY BECAUSE PUTIN
IS NOT ABLE TO SUCCEED ON THE

00:03:21.934 --> 00:03:24.070
BATTLEFIELD.
HE IS TAKING THE WAR TO UKRAINE

00:03:24.070 --> 00:03:25.872
CIVILIANS.
HE IS DOING IT IN A VERY

00:03:25.872 --> 00:03:27.974
DELIBERATE WAY.
HE IS GOING AFTER THE ENTIRE

00:03:27.974 --> 00:03:30.476
ENERGY AND ELECTRIC
INFRASTRUCTURE.

00:03:30.476 --> 00:03:32.245
HE WANTS TO TURN OFF THE
LIGHTS.

00:03:32.245 --> 00:03:34.881
HE WANTS TO TURN OFF THE WATER,
TURN OFF THE HEAT.

00:03:34.881 --> 00:03:37.884
THAT COMES AT A TIME WHEN
UKRAINE IS HEADED INTO THE

00:03:37.884 --> 00:03:40.920
WINTER.
THE HEAD OF NATO, JAN

00:03:40.920 --> 00:03:43.456
STOLTENBERG, HE TALKED ABOUT
WEAPONIZING WINTER.

00:03:43.456 --> 00:03:46.125
THAT IS EXACTLY WHAT VLADIMIR
PUTIN IS DOING.

00:03:46.125 --> 00:03:51.064
THIS IS ALL SOUL, WAIANAE ARE
WE SEEING TO MAKE SURE THAT

00:03:51.064 --> 00:03:54.000
UKRAINE HAS THE SYSTEMS IT
NEEDS TO DEFEND ITSELF, BUT WE

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:57.036
ARE ALSO MAKING SURE THAT WE
ARE DOING EVERYTHING POSSIBLE

00:03:57.036 --> 00:04:00.840
AND AS QUICKLY AS POSSIBLE TO
HELP THEM REPAIR AND REPLACE

00:04:00.840 --> 00:04:03.009
EVERYTHING THAT HAS BEEN
DESTROYED BY THE RUSSIAN

00:04:03.009 --> 00:04:06.846
ONSLAUGHT.
JUST AS WE PUT THIS PROCESS

00:04:06.846 --> 00:04:10.016
TOGETHER SOME MONTHS AGO IN
RAMSTEIN, JEREMY, WE WANT TO

00:04:10.016 --> 00:04:11.951
GET THEM THE DEFENSIVE WEAPON
SYSTEMS THEY NEED.

00:04:11.951 --> 00:04:15.822
SO TOO WE ARE DOING THAT WITH
ENERGY, WITH EQUIPMENT, WITH

00:04:15.822 --> 00:04:17.156
TRANSFORMERS.
WITH GENERATORS.

00:04:17.156 --> 00:04:19.459
WITH A SPARE PARTS.
.

00:04:19.459 --> 00:04:23.863
WE ADMIT HERE IN BUCHAREST.
THIS IS NOT JUST WITH NATO

00:04:23.863 --> 00:04:25.231
ALLIES.
BUT WITH THE G7 COUNTRIES AND

00:04:25.231 --> 00:04:28.935
SOME OTHER COUNTRIES.
WE PUT IN PLACE A VERY

00:04:28.935 --> 00:04:33.005
COORDINATED PROCESS TO MAKE
SURE THAT WE ARE GETTING

00:04:33.005 --> 00:04:35.041
UKRAINE WHAT IT NEEDS TO GET
THROUGH THE WINTER.

00:04:35.041 --> 00:04:36.909
.
WE'RE MAKING SURE THAT MAN,

00:04:36.909 --> 00:04:41.914
WOMEN, AND CHILDREN ARE NOT
LITERALLY FREEZING TO DEATH.

00:04:41.914 --> 00:04:44.350
THIS IS MY FRIEND AND
COUNTERPART.

00:04:44.350 --> 00:04:47.120
HE JUST CAME FROM KYIV AND
DESCRIBED ALL OF THE MINISTERS

00:04:47.120 --> 00:04:49.989
HERE.
THIS IS WHAT LIFE IS LIKE UNDER

00:04:49.989 --> 00:04:54.059
THE RUSSIAN ONSLAUGHT.
BY THE WAY, THIS IS NOT NORMAL.

00:04:54.059 --> 00:04:57.263
THIS IS THE BRUTALIZATION OF A
COUNTRY.

00:04:57.263 --> 00:05:01.067
IT IS DIRECTLY ATTACKING
EVERYTHING THAT ITS CIVILIANS

00:05:01.067 --> 00:05:05.905
ADDITIONS NEED TO SIMPLY
SURVIVE.

00:05:05.905 --> 00:05:09.041
OF THE WORLD UNDERSTANDS IT AND
SEES IT THAT WAY.

00:05:09.041 --> 00:05:11.911
WE ARE PLEASED WITH THIS.
WE ARE ACTING IN A WAY TO GET

00:05:11.911 --> 00:05:15.114
UKRAINE EVERYTHING WE POSSIBLY
CAN TO GET THROUGH THAT WINTER.

00:05:15.114 --> 00:05:18.951
&gt;&gt; ONE LAST QUESTION ON THIS
ISSUE OF WEAPONRY AND WHAT THEY

00:05:18.951 --> 00:05:21.086
NEED.
THE NEW YORK TIMES REPORTING

00:05:21.086 --> 00:05:26.859
THAT U.S. NATO ARE CONSIDERING
INVESTING IN SLOVAKIA, THE

00:05:26.859 --> 00:05:32.898
CZECH REPUBLIC, BULGARIA.
THESE ARE FACTORIES THAT HAVE

00:05:32.898 --> 00:05:35.301
MADE SOVIET ERA AMMUNITION FOR
ARTILLERY.

00:05:35.301 --> 00:05:37.303
APPARENTLY UKRAINE IS MOSTLY
USING IT.

00:05:37.303 --> 00:05:44.277
IS THAT CORRECT?
&gt;&gt; WE ARE LOOKING AT THAT.

00:05:44.277 --> 00:05:48.915
THEY GET WHAT THEY NEED, WHAT
CAN BE MOST EFFECTIVE FOR THEM.

00:05:48.915 --> 00:05:52.185
SOME OF THAT GOES TO THE
SOVIET-ERA SYSTEM THEY HAD IN

00:05:52.185 --> 00:05:55.888
THEIR INVENTORY FOR DECADES.
FOR EXAMPLE, THEY MADE SURE

00:05:55.888 --> 00:05:59.892
THAT THE AMMUNITION WAS THERE
FOR THOSE SYSTEMS.

00:05:59.892 --> 00:06:02.895
IN SOME CASES, THEY MIGHT
PRODUCE THINGS THAT HAVE NOT

00:06:02.895 --> 00:06:05.198
BEEN PRODUCED FOR SOMETIME.
WE ARE LOOKING ACROSS THE BOARD

00:06:05.198 --> 00:06:10.002
AT ALL OF THAT.
EVEN AS WE ARE WORKING TO GET

00:06:10.002 --> 00:06:13.005
UKRAINE WHAT THEY NEEDED MOST
URGENTLY, WE ARE ALSO WORKING

00:06:13.005 --> 00:06:15.875
TO MAKE SURE THAT OVER THE
MEDIUM AND LONG TERM THAT WE

00:06:15.875 --> 00:06:18.077
ARE HELPING THEM TO BUILD UP
THEIR CAPACITY TO DETER AND

00:06:18.077 --> 00:06:21.948
DEFEND AGAINST FUTURE
AGGRESSION.

00:06:21.948 --> 00:06:25.251
WHEN THIS WAR COMES TO AN END
ONE, OF THE THINGS THAT IS

00:06:25.251 --> 00:06:26.853
GONNA BE SO CRITICAL OF MAKING
SURE THAT WE HAVE DONE

00:06:26.853 --> 00:06:30.122
EVERYTHING POSSIBLE TO ENSURE
THAT IT IS NOW REPEAT ITSELF.

00:06:30.122 --> 00:06:33.226
RUSSIA DOES NOT RENEW ITS
AGGRESSION AGAINST UKRAINE.

00:06:33.226 --> 00:06:36.329
PART OF THAT IS MAKING SURE
THAT THE UKRAINE HAS, OVER THE

00:06:36.329 --> 00:06:40.867
LONG TERM, THE ABILITY TO DETER
AGGRESSIONS AND DEFEND ITSELF

00:06:40.867 --> 00:06:42.301
IF AGGRESSION COMES.
.

00:06:42.301 --> 00:06:47.874
&gt;&gt; CAN I MOVE ON TO A NON-?
ON THE ONE HAND, YOU AND OTHERS

00:06:47.874 --> 00:06:52.011
ACCUSE THEM OF SUPPLYING
RUSSIANS WITH MUCH WEAPONRY.

00:06:52.011 --> 00:06:59.218
MERCEDES KAMIKAZE DRONES.
HUGE AMOUNT OF DAMAGE AND

00:06:59.218 --> 00:07:01.220
DEATH.
I ALSO WANT TO ASK YOU ABOUT

00:07:01.220 --> 00:07:05.992
YOUR REACTION TO THE COURT.
IRAN HAS TOLD YOU THE

00:07:05.992 --> 00:07:14.066
INTERNATIONAL COMMUNITY THAT IT
PLANS TO UPGRADE AND INCREASE

00:07:14.066 --> 00:07:21.073
IT'S PRODUCTION.
IT IS NEAR BOMB CAPACITY.

00:07:21.073 --> 00:07:26.879
MOVE NOT TO AN AREA THAT IS
DIFFICULT FOR YOU TO ATTACK.

00:07:26.879 --> 00:07:33.019
YOU CAN INCREASE NUCLEAR FUEL
PRODUCTION IN OTHER PLACES.

00:07:33.019 --> 00:07:36.388
THE UNITED STATES AND ISRAEL
ARE ACCUSED OF SABOTAGE.

00:07:36.388 --> 00:07:39.025
WHAT IS YOUR REACTION TO THAT?
HAVE THEY TOLD YOU THAT?

00:07:39.025 --> 00:07:44.897
&gt;&gt; CHRISTIANE, I THINK THAT THE
WORLD IS FOCUSED ON WHAT IS

00:07:44.897 --> 00:07:47.333
HAPPENING ON THE STREETS IN
IRAN THROUGHOUT THE COUNTRY.

00:07:47.333 --> 00:07:52.438
[INTERPRETER]
&gt;&gt; THOSE ARE INCREDIBLY BRAVE

00:07:52.438 --> 00:07:54.273
YOUNG PEOPLE.
THEY ARE MOSTLY WOMEN.

00:07:54.273 --> 00:07:57.209
THEY ARE STANDING UP, SPEAKING
OUT FOR THEIR MOST BASIC

00:07:57.209 --> 00:08:01.213
RIGHTS.
THAT IS THE CASE SINCE THE

00:08:01.213 --> 00:08:04.150
KILLING OF AUSTIN AMINI SOME
MONTHS AGO.

00:08:04.150 --> 00:08:06.485
THAT IS WHERE THE WORLD'S FOCUS
IS.

00:08:06.485 --> 00:08:09.322
THAT IS WHERE OUR FOCUS IS.
WE HAVE TAKEN STEPS TO SANCTION

00:08:09.322 --> 00:08:18.130
THOSE WHO HAVE BEEN RESPONSIBLE.
WE HAVE WORKED AS WELL TO MAKE

00:08:18.130 --> 00:08:22.167
SURE THAT IRANIANS, TO THE BEST
OF OUR ABILITY, THEY HAVE THE

00:08:22.167 --> 00:08:24.570
COMMUNICATIONS TECHNOLOGY THEY
NEED TO CONTINUE COMMUNICATING

00:08:24.570 --> 00:08:26.339
WITH ONE ANOTHER.
THEY ARE STAYING CONNECTED TO

00:08:26.339 --> 00:08:32.378
THE OUTSIDE WORLD.
WE HAVE CONTINUE TO BELIEVE

00:08:32.378 --> 00:08:35.281
THAT THE BEST WAY TO DEAL WITH
IRAN'S NUCLEAR THREAT IS

00:08:35.281 --> 00:08:38.584
THROUGH DIPLOMACY.
YOU KNOW THAT WE HAVEN'T AGREED

00:08:38.584 --> 00:08:42.388
WITH THE JCPOA A.
WE PUT IRAN'S NUCLEAR PROTEST

00:08:42.388 --> 00:08:44.590
IN THE BOX.
THIS DECISION WAS MADE A POINT

00:08:44.590 --> 00:08:47.259
OF THAT AGREEMENT.
WHAT WE HAVE SEEN VIRTUALLY

00:08:47.259 --> 00:08:50.129
EVER SINCE IT IS IRAN BUILDING
BACK THE PROGRAM.

00:08:50.129 --> 00:08:53.432
WE HAVE BEEN VERY CLEAR WITH
THEM NOT JUST THE UNITED STATES

00:08:53.432 --> 00:08:57.169
THESE ARE OTHERS.
THAT INCLUDES EUROPEAN PARTNERS

00:08:57.169 --> 00:09:01.607
THEY SHOULD NOT TAKE ADDITIONAL
STEPS TO INCREASE THEIR NUCLEAR

00:09:01.607 --> 00:09:06.145
CAPACITY.
THAT INCLUDES BY AND WATCHING

00:09:06.145 --> 00:09:09.715
THIS TO HIGHER LEVELS.
--

00:09:09.715 --> 00:09:12.852
&gt;&gt; NEXT TRIP IS TO CHINA.
I BELIEVE IT WILL BE YOUR FIRST

00:09:12.852 --> 00:09:14.654
TRIP AS THE SECRETARY OF STATE.
PRESIDENT BIDEN HAS.

00:09:14.654 --> 00:09:20.826
BEEN --
HE WANTED TO LOWER THE

00:09:20.826 --> 00:09:23.696
TEMPERATURE MAKE SURE WE DON'T
ENTER A NEW COLD WAR I WANT TO

00:09:23.696 --> 00:09:24.963
ASK YOU THIS.
THIS IS WHAT CHINA DID ALONG

00:09:24.963 --> 00:09:29.468
WITH SAUDI ARABIA TO BLOCK ANY
MEANINGFUL --

00:09:29.468 --> 00:09:38.577
THIS IS COP27.
THIS IS HOW THE INTERNATIONAL

00:09:38.577 --> 00:09:41.414
RELATIONS --
IF THEY'RE NOT GONNA PLAY BALL

00:09:41.414 --> 00:09:45.418
ON CLIMATE, IF THEY ARE ANGRY
ABOUT TAIWAN, PARTICULARLY WITH

00:09:45.418 --> 00:09:50.523
NANCY PELOSI'S VISIT, WHAT IS
IT THAT YOU HAVE TO TALK ABOUT?

00:09:50.523 --> 00:09:58.397
CAN YOU HOPE TO VISIT IN CHINA?
&gt;&gt; PRESIDENT BIDEN AND

00:09:58.397 --> 00:10:01.467
PRESIDENT XI HAD AN IMPORTANT
MEETING.

00:10:01.467 --> 00:10:06.639
ONE THAT WAS PRODUCTIVE IN THE
SENSE THAT IT IS IMPORTANT THAT

00:10:06.639 --> 00:10:14.480
WE COMMUNICATE CLEARLY.
WE DISCUSS OUR INTERESTS, OUR

00:10:14.480 --> 00:10:23.422
INTENTIONS, OUR POLICIES.
WE ARE CURRENTLY IN COOPERATION

00:10:23.422 --> 00:10:27.560
WITH CHINA.
WE ARE NOT AT LEAST

00:10:27.560 --> 00:10:29.128
UNDERSTANDING WHAT OTHERS ARE
TRYING TO DO.

00:10:29.128 --> 00:10:31.597
THAT IS SOMETHING THAT WE HAVE
TO GUARD AGAINST.

00:10:31.597 --> 00:10:36.602
THAT IS NECESSARY PARTICULARLY
IF PRESIDENT BIDEN SAYS THAT

00:10:36.602 --> 00:10:39.371
THE --
IT DOES NOT LEAD US IN THE

00:10:39.371 --> 00:10:41.207
CONFLICT NO ONE HAS AN INTEREST
IN THAT.

00:10:41.207 --> 00:10:44.710
FIRST AND FOREMOST, THE TRUTH
THAT I WILL TAKE EARLY NEXT

00:10:44.710 --> 00:10:49.415
YEARS ABOUT CONTINUING THAT
COMMUNICATION.

00:10:49.415 --> 00:10:55.755
THEY ARE OPEN EVEN WE DISAGREE.
ONLY DISAGREE PROFOUNDLY.

